  "solution": {
    "text": "The colors of wavelengths are absorbed in decreasing order of wavelengths.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#955;</mi> <mtext>red</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#62;</mo> <msub> <mi>&#955;</mi> <mtext>yellow</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#62;</mo> <msub> <mi>&#955;</mi> <mtext>green</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#62;</mo> <msub> <mi>&#955;</mi> <mtext>blue</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mtext>Red</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#60;</mo> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mtext>Yellow</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#60;</mo> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mtext>Green</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#60;</mo> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mtext>Blue</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math><br /><br />As the order of ligand field strength provides the order of relative crystal field splitting energies. &nbsp;",
